{
  "_comment": "OpenClaw 两层 strictness 模式。base → strict:true + noImplicitAny:true。诊断目录额外开启返回值检查和无贯穿检查。noUnusedLocals 暂不开启（传播到外部文件产生 39 条噪音，非类型安全风险）。",
  "extends": "../../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "rootDir": "./src",
    "outDir": "./dist",
    "noImplicitReturns": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true
  },
  "include": [
    "src/pipeline/diagnosis/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "src/**/__tests__/**",
    "dist/**",
    "node_modules/**"
  ]
}
